  "description": "Big jumps. Huge drops. Challenging lines. Our NDURO 8 FREERIDE is your buddy for unforgettable freeride adventures in the Alps, and it’ll make you look great in the bike park, too. With strong components like RockShox suspension boasting 180mm of travel front and rear, Sram GX Eagle drivetrain and Sram Maven Bronze brakes, this gravity eMTB has everything a downhill rider could wish for – including a mullet setup with a 29″ wheel at the front and 27.5″ at the back. And once you’re at the bottom, the powerful Yamaha PW-X3 motor with a 720Wh battery will easily take you back up the mountain, ready for another run. Get ready to take on the next jumps, drops and lines.",
